SUMMARY:IECON 2026: Paper submission (extended) (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:Annual Conference of the IEEE Industrial Electronics Society (I
 ECON 2026)\n\nPaper submission (extended): 31 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (ass
 umed)\n\nConference: October 18-21\, 2026\nLocation: Doha\, Qatar\n\nAll d
 ates:\n  Paper submission (extended): 31 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)
 \n  Acceptance notification: 10 Aug 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final
  submission and registration: 20 Sept 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe
  call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earli
 est it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real de
 adline rather than after it.\n\n52nd annual conference of the IES\, held i
 n Doha with online participation and presentation also offered.\n\nCall fo
 r papers: https://www.iecon2026.org/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.
 io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/iecon26
LOCATION:Doha\, Qatar
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.iecon2026.org/
